  <h1 class="page-title">Sweepstakes Casino Gift Card Redemptions</h1>
  <p class="lede">Gift cards are the low-minimum payout rail: useful for smaller or retail-focused redemptions, but not equivalent to unrestricted cash.</p>
  <div class="answer-first"><span class="af-label">Direct answer</span><p>Gift-card redemptions suit smaller balances because minimums are lower - McLuck requires 10 SC for a gift card versus 75 SC for a bank transfer. Among operators documented here, Chumba Casino and McLuck support gift-card redemptions.</p></div>

